        <mxCell id="e_edge4" value="Cache Miss" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;strokeColor=#4285F4;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4285F4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="i_cdn" target="i_elb"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lg" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#202124&quot;&gt;설계 원칙 (MSP Design Principles)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;필수 요구사항&lt;/b&gt; — 3-Tier 분리 / External·Internal LB / Apache mod_proxy / Cloud SQL Private IP&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;공인 IP 최소화&lt;/b&gt; — 모든 VM은 External IP 미할당, 외부 통신은 Cloud NAT 경유&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Zero Trust 관리 접근&lt;/b&gt; — SSH 22 포트 인터넷 개방 금지, IAP TCP Forwarding + Bastion&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Stateless WAS&lt;/b&gt; — Memorystore Redis 세션 외부화로 MIG 스케일 아웃/인 안전&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Regional MIG&lt;/b&gt; — 3개 Zone 분산 배치로 Zone 장애에도 서비스 지속 (99.99%)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;최소 권한&lt;/b&gt; — Network Tag 기반 방화벽, IAM 역할 분리, Secret Manager 자격증명 분리&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;관측 가능성&lt;/b&gt; — Ops Agent 전면 배포, SLO 기반 알림 (단순 임계치 알림 지양)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5F6368;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=8;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1500" y="130" width="750" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="proj" value="Google Cloud Project:  nova-petclinic-prd      (Org Policy · VPC Service Controls 적용)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;strokeColor=#5F6368;fillColor=#F8F9FA;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#202124;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="350" width="2200" height="880" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
