        <mxCell id="pa_n" value="• &lt;b&gt;Ops Agent&lt;/b&gt; 전 VM 배포 → CPU/메모리/디스크/프로세스 + &lt;b&gt;Apache·Tomcat·MySQL&lt;/b&gt; 플러그인 메트릭&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Uptime Check&lt;/b&gt; (다중 리전) + &lt;b&gt;SLO&lt;/b&gt; 99.9% 가용성 / p95 &amp;lt; 500ms → Burn-rate 알림&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;알림 채널&lt;/b&gt;: Email · Google Chat · Slack · SMS  (Sev1 즉시 / Sev2 15분 집계)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Log Router&lt;/b&gt; → GCS(장기 보관 365일) · BigQuery(분석) · Log-based Metric(5xx 비율)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Trace / Profiler / Error Reporting&lt;/b&gt; 으로 WAS 지연·예외 근본 원인 분석" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DADCE0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=8;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="68" y="1400" width="674" height="162" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
