        <mxCell id="pb_n" value="• &lt;b&gt;VM&lt;/b&gt;: Snapshot Schedule 매일 03:00 KST (일 7 / 주 4 / 월 12 보존) + Machine Image(골든)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;DB&lt;/b&gt;: Cloud SQL 자동 백업 03:30 KST + &lt;b&gt;PITR&lt;/b&gt;(binlog 7일) + 월 1회 온디맨드&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;파일 반출&lt;/b&gt;: Cloud Scheduler → Pub/Sub → Cloud Functions → Cloud SQL &lt;b&gt;Export&lt;/b&gt; → GCS&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;GCS 정책&lt;/b&gt;: Dual-region · Object Versioning · Retention Lock · Lifecycle&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Standard → Nearline(30d) → Coldline(90d) → Archive(365d)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;복구 훈련&lt;/b&gt;: 분기 1회 스냅샷 복원 + DB PITR 리허설 (복구 절차 문서화)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#DADCE0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;spacingRight=8;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="804" y="1400" width="674" height="162" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pc" value="⑧ 보안 · 거버넌스  (Security &amp; Governance)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;strokeColor=#EA4335;fillColor=#FEF4F3;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#EA4335;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1522" y="1258" width="728" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
